    @template mod_webconferens/start_room

    Body of the live tab. The embedded layout prints the Moodle head.

    1. PHP checks login and mints the access token.
    2. view.php calls mod_webconferens/start_room through js_call_amd.
    3. That module loads video_conference.js, hangs AES, then fills #webconferens-app.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "jsmissing": false,
        "jsmissingtext": ""
    }
}}
{{#jsmissing}}
<p class="webconferens-missing">{{jsmissingtext}}</p>
{{/jsmissing}}
{{^jsmissing}}
{{> mod_webconferens/room }}
{{/jsmissing}}
